 Run;EWC
⍝ Bring up EWC in Multi mode for the Playwright multi-session suite.
⍝
⍝ Called from ci/setup-ewc-multi.apl once EWC and this namespace have been
⍝ linked. Unlike Browser mode — where demo.Run blocks until a browser turns
⍝ up — Init returns immediately in Multi mode: EWC.Init starts the Conga
⍝ server and nothing else exists yet. Each browser connection later clones
⍝ #.mtest into #.mtest_N and spawns Initialise in its own thread.

 EWC←##.EWC
 EWC.PORT←22323
 EWC.SHOWDEVTOOLS←0

 ⍝ The close log lives OUTSIDE this namespace, deliberately. newSession
 ⍝ clones #.mtest per session and endSession ⎕EX's the clone, so a log held
 ⍝ in here would be destroyed along with the very session it recorded.
 ⍝ #.mtestlog survives every session and is reachable from all of them.
 :If 0=#.⎕NC'mtestlog'
     'mtestlog'#.⎕NS''
     #.mtestlog.closed←0⍴⊂''
 :EndIf

 'e'EWC.Init'Multi'

 ⎕←'mtest running in Multi mode on port ',⍕EWC.PORT
